msgid ""
"The directory of keys and certificates. The default is "
"``/var/lib/sibuna/acme``."
msgstr "की और सर्टिफ़िकेट की डायरेक्टरी। डिफ़ॉल्ट ``/var/lib/sibuna/acme`` है।"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:209
msgid "``--acme-dns-hook PROGRAM``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:210
msgid ""
"The program that answers the DNS-01 challenge, which a wildcard "
