msgstr ""
"पहले हैंडशेक पर उस नाम के लिए भी सर्टिफ़िकेट ले लें जिसे ``GET "
"URL?domain=NAME`` 200 से 299 तक के स्टेटस के साथ मंज़ूरी देता है।"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:215
msgid "``--health PATH|tcp``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:216
msgid "Probe each server with ``GET PATH``, or with a TCP connect."
msgstr "हर सर्वर को ``GET PATH`` से, या TCP connect से प्रोब करें।"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:217
msgid "``--firewall off|gate|shield``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:218
msgid "The HTTP surface. The default is ``off``."
msgstr "HTTP सरफ़ेस। डिफ़ॉल्ट ``off`` है।"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:219
msgid "``--admin SOCKET``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:220
