#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2984
msgid ""
"A request passes local bans and the rate limit, then inspection and "
"policy. A DENY goes to Deny. An ALLOW goes to the origin or an auth "
"success. A CHALLENGE checks the session MAC: a valid session goes to the "
"origin, a missing or invalid one leads to a new puzzle."
msgstr ""
"रिक्वेस्ट पहले लोकल बैन और रेट लिमिट से गुज़रती है, फिर इंस्पेक्शन और "
"पॉलिसी से। DENY, Deny पर जाता है। ALLOW ऑरिजिन या auth सफलता पर जाता है। "
"CHALLENGE सेशन MAC जाँचता है: वैलिड सेशन ऑरिजिन पर जाता है, मिसिंग या "
"अमान्य सेशन नया पज़ल जारी करता है।"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:2984
msgid ""
"// operations.rst: how the Shield surface routes a request.\n"
"#import \"style.typ\": *\n"
"#show: figure-frame.with(lang: \"en\")\n"
"\n"
"#flow(\n"
"  spacing: (9mm, 7mm),\n"
"  data((1, 0), \"Request\", name: <request>),\n"
"  step((1, 1), \"Local bans and rate limit\", name: <limits>),\n"
"  decision((1, 2), \"Inspection\\nand policy\", name: <policy>),\n"
"  outcome((0, 3), \"Deny\", kind: \"stop\", name: <deny>),\n"
"  decision((2, 3), \"Session MAC?\", name: <session>),\n"
"  outcome((1, 4), \"Origin or auth success\", name: <origin>),\n"
"  outcome((3, 4), \"Issue a puzzle\", kind: \"wait\", name: <puzzle>),\n"
"  edge(<request>, <limits>, \"-|>\"),\n"
"  edge(<limits>, <policy>, \"-|>\", say(\"within limits\"), label-side: "
"left),\n"
"  tone-edge(\"stop\", <policy>, <deny>, \"-|>\", say-in(\"stop\", "
"\"`DENY`\"), label-side: right),\n"
"  main-edge(<policy>, <origin>, \"-|>\", say-in(\"good\", \"`ALLOW`\"), "
